{
  "uid": "fairwins-finops-overview",
  "title": "FairWins FinOps — Overview",
  "description": "GENERATED by scripts/finops/generate-dashboards.js from @fairwins/finops-catalogue. Do not edit by hand — run `npm run finops:generate`. `npm run check:finops` fails when this file is stale.",
  "tags": [
    "finops",
    "generated"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "Data source"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# FairWins FinOps — overview\n\nEvery figure here carries its own honesty state. **A missing source is never shown as `0`.**\n\n- **Sources currently MISSING** — if that table has rows, the totals above it are *partial and understated*.\n- **(modelled)** in a panel title means the dollar figure is our arithmetic over a declared plan rate, not an invoice.\n  Only GCP is `billed`. Cloudflare and QuickNode publish no dollar figure at all (spec 089 research R1).\n- **NOT YET LIVE** panels are declared sources with nothing to read. They contribute nothing to any total.\n- Freshness differs by source: chain reads are seconds old, the GCP billing export lags hours. See *Source health*."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Revenue (by unit)",
      "description": "Sum of live revenue sources, per unit. Accrued and waived are deliberately excluded — neither is revenue received.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "no value published — see “Source health” for whether this is unreadable or not-configured",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (unit) (fairwins_finops_revenue_total)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{unit}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cost (USD, by basis)",
      "description": "Sum of live cost sources, split by basis. `billed` came from an invoice; `modelled` is our arithmetic.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "no value published — see “Source health” for whether this is unreadable or not-configured",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (basis) (fairwins_finops_cost_usd_total)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{unit}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Net (USDC revenue − USD cost)",
      "description": "A deliberately narrow net: USDC revenue minus total USD cost. It exists only when BOTH sides have data, because a net computed against a missing cost side reads as profit.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "no value published — see “Source health” for whether this is unreadable or not-configured",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(fairwins_finops_revenue_total{unit=\"USDC\"}) - sum(fairwins_finops_cost_usd_total) and on() (count(fairwins_finops_source_up{kind=\"cost\"} == 1) > 0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{unit}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Revenue totals — sources currently MISSING",
      "description": "Any row here means the revenue total above is PARTIAL and understated. An empty table means every live revenue source was read. Sources that are merely not-configured are excluded on purpose: they are unwired features, not missing data.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "all live sources reporting",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fairwins_finops_source_configured{kind=\"revenue\",status=\"live\"} == 1 unless on(source) fairwins_finops_source_up == 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Cost totals — sources currently MISSING",
      "description": "Any row here means the cost total above is PARTIAL and understated. An empty table means every live cost source was read. Sources that are merely not-configured are excluded on purpose: they are unwired features, not missing data.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "all live sources reporting",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fairwins_finops_source_configured{kind=\"cost\",status=\"live\"} == 1 unless on(source) fairwins_finops_source_up == 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Source health — read / unreadable / not-configured",
      "description": "configured=1 & up=1 → read. configured=1 & up=0 → UNREADABLE (a real problem). configured=0 → not-configured (a feature that has not been wired up; not an outage). This is the panel that tells you which of those a blank panel above is: they look identical everywhere else, and they are not the same thing to act on.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fairwins_finops_source_configured"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fairwins_finops_source_up"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "time() - fairwins_finops_source_last_success_timestamp_seconds"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Prepaid pool runway",
      "description": "Projected seconds until each prepaid pool empties, at the trailing burn rate. A pool with NO LINE has an unknown runway (zero or unmeasured burn) — that is not the same as a long runway, and it is why this panel reads the exporter series instead of dividing balance by burn here.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "runway unknown — check pool balance and source health",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 259200
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 604800
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fairwins_finops_pool_runway_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "{{pool}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Prepaid pool balances",
      "description": "Native-unit balance of each prepaid pool. Never summed across units.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "no data — pool unreadable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fairwins_finops_pool_balance",
          "legendFormat": "{{pool}} ({{unit}})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cost per sponsored UserOp (1h)",
      "description": "Paymaster gas spend divided by sponsored ops over the same window. NOT COMPUTED when either input is unavailable — a ratio built on a missing denominator is a fabricated number, not an estimate.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 6,
          "noValue": "not computed — an input was unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(rate(fairwins_finops_cost_usd_total{source=\"paymaster-gas\"}[1h])) / (rate(fairwins_finops_sponsored_ops_total[1h])) and on() (fairwins_finops_source_up{source=\"paymaster-gas\"} == 1)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Infra cost per USDC of revenue (24h)",
      "description": "Total modelled + billed infrastructure cost against USDC revenue. Not computed if either side is missing.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 33
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 6,
          "noValue": "not computed — an input was unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(fairwins_finops_cost_usd_total[24h]))) / (sum(rate(fairwins_finops_revenue_total{unit=\"USDC\"}[24h]))) and on() (fairwins_finops_source_up{source=\"gcp\"} == 1)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "type": "table",
      "title": "FX rate provenance",
      "description": "The rate used for every USD conversion on this dashboard, its source, and its age. A conversion made from a stale rate is visibly stale here rather than silently applied.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fairwins_finops_fx_rate"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fairwins_finops_fx_age_seconds"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
